  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advanced cross-river capacities for trade/AdTrade. The overall objective and expected outcome of this project is to secure that men and women on both banks of the Nistru River have better livelihoods and living conditions, due to an improved cross-river cooperation to access the opportunities offered by Moldova&amp;rsquo;s external trade arrangements, contributing to an environment of trust and cooperation across the post-conflict divide.The focus of the project will be given to the SMEs as the deve</narrative>
  </description>
