   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1 Number of Business Associations (BAs) with sufficient capacity to effectively advocate, cooperate and support the interests of business communities across the river (activity 1.1.)
1.2 Number of representatives of companies and business associations in the Transnistrian region aware of the opportunities provided by DCFTA, as well as the technical steps needed to access EU markets (activity 1.2.)
1.3 Partnerships between Business Associations (BAs) and relevant CSOs from both banks, including at least one partnership of Women BAs (activity 1.1.)
2.1 Number of companies from both banks, including Women owned Businesses (WoB) that received consultancy/certification support from cross river business development services institutions/networks to promote their exports (activity 2.3)
